{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方第一段大号白色与紫色文字，尤其是“忘了藏好喜欢”“看出他有多在乎”；视线随后容易被下方第二段同样醒目的大字吸引。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他这次没能藏住自己的喜欢，被对方看出了自己有多在乎。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"能抓到喜欢、在乎；具体的心理感受不确定。\",\n  \"missed\": \"被看穿之后，他心里空落落的，不知道该怎么相处，担心对方嫌自己太黏，原本亲近的关系似乎因此隔了一层。小字还提出了对幸福真实性的怀疑。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"上下两块大号文字都很显眼，争夺主视线。\",\n    \"核心处境和核心情绪分散在两块文字中，需要拼接才能理解前因后果。\",\n    \"第二块文字本身包含空落、担心被嫌弃、亲近感变淡等多个层次。\",\n    \"放大的“忘了藏好喜欢”“看出他有多在乎”能说明感情暴露，却不能直接说明暴露之后的心理反应。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a31d067c-fa3f-4b36-a264-7642e8ac06fc", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T010958435222Z", "elapsed_seconds": 22.016, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:10:20.457272+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "82538cb241cc9f9a421faa2be61745c463ab250ca321d21eb59ce9e5f1c07e2a", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f14